                                                                            'groups and network controls '
                                                                            'separately.',
                                                                            'Deleting a mount target forcibly '
                                                                            'breaks mounts using it and can '
                                                                            'disrupt applications. Keep backups, '
                                                                            'client coordination and a validated '
                                                                            'rollback plan; a shared route-table '
                                                                            'change can affect all resources in '
                                                                            'its subnet.',
